sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor U as User
  participant C as Chat + its server
  participant J as Backend + database
  participant AI as Groq or Anthropic
  U->>C: Question (+ page context)
  C->>J: POST /api/ai/chat
  Note over J: Role, last 8 turns, catalogue,<br/>ratings, the person's own orders.<br/>Prompt built for this role
  J->>AI: Chat request
  opt Per-minute limit reached
    J->>AI: Next fallback model
  end
  AI-->>J: Answer (+ screen shortcut)
  Note over J: Shortcut kept only if the role<br/>may open it. Turns saved for<br/>signed-in users
  J-->>C: Answer + shortcut button
